# NOT excluded: server/typescript/** ships the TypeScript library the language
# server self-resolves at runtime (Phase 85 REQ-V16) — a future *.d.ts / lib/**
# exclusion added above would silently ship a type-less server. `server/` is
# gitignored (build output) but that does not affect vsce packaging: vsce only
# honors .vscodeignore when one exists, never .gitignore. See bundle-server.mjs.
!server/typescript/**
